Package: IFFuzzyStats
Type: Package
Title: Intuitionistic Fuzzy Statistics Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Mukul", "Bijalwan", email = "mukulbijalwan555@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-3040-6912")), person("Gunjan", "Aggrwal", role = "aut"), person("Mukul", "Jain", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Mukul Bijalwan <mukulbijalwan555@gmail.com>
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for intuitionistic fuzzy sets (Atanassov, 1986):
    constructors and arithmetics for intuitionistic fuzzy values, Xu and Yager
    aggregation operators (IFWA, IFWG, IFOWA, IFOWG, IFHA, IFHG, Einstein),
    entropy and distance/similarity measures (Szmidt-Kacprzyk, Vlachos-Sergiadis,
    Ye, Hamming, Euclidean, Hausdorff and others), intuitionistic fuzzy
    c-means and k-means clustering, approximate reasoning / compositional
    inference, and multi-criteria decision helpers (IF-TOPSIS, score ranking).
    All computations use only base R with fully vectorised implementations.
